| Tool under evaluation | Sigma Computing — cloud BI with a spreadsheet-style UI. Has no data engine or import layer of its own. Every query runs live in the connected warehouse. |
| Connections in scope | Snowflake connection; Databricks (Unity Catalog) connection |
| Incumbent for comparison | MicroStrategy / Strategy ONE (Intelligent Cubes + live reports) |
| Key constraint | No new tables, views, schemas, or catalogs in Snowflake or Databricks beyond approved source tables. Production may not allow table creation at all. |
