### 11. SDLC & Deployment — 8%
**Assess**
- Version tags (Dev/Test/Prod), protected tags and approvals, source swapping between environments.
- Data models as code (GA via API) and workbooks as code (private beta).
- Git/CI-CD integration via REST API.

**How to test**
1. Build in Dev; tag "Test"; swap the source to the Test connection/schema; promote to "Production"; roll back.
2. Export a data model as YAML; commit to Git; change it; push it back via API.
3. Ask Sigma for workbooks-as-code beta access; record status.

**Pass**
- Repeatable, auditable promotion without manual rebuild. Note beta items.

